==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Tympole|42}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion; both cards have the Mud-Slap attack.
*{{m|Mud-Slap}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Tympole}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

